    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>With our newsletters you are always up to date on the latest in tool presetting, tool measuring, tool management, and more. Register here to receive our newsletter approximately 6 times a year with information on<strong> current trends and user reports, ZOLLER products, and invitations to trade fairs and events</strong>.</p> <p>By registering, you accept our privacy policy and agree that ZOLLER may send you information about products and services, current promotions and interesting facts about our company by e-mail. By registering, you consent to the processing of personal data for the purpose of creating personalized newsletters and statistical evaluations. After registering, you will receive an e-mail from us with a confirmation link. Your registration is not complete until you click on this link. You can revoke your consent at any time, which also means that you will be unsubscribed from our newsletter. To do so, send an informal e-mail to <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"mailto:news@zoller.info\">news@zoller.info</a> or click on the unsubscribe link in the newsletter.</p>",
